# Order: Stonard -> Searing Gorge (+ grind to 50) -> Undercity / Orgrimmar / Thunder Bluff hand-ins -> Gadgetzan (bind) ->
# Un'Goro Crater (south-east corner, two loops out of Marshal's Refuge, out past Torwa) -> hearth Gadgetzan -> Thunder Bluff / Orgrimmar (bind) -> Azshara ->
# Jediga's tablet deliveries (Orgrimmar / Undercity / Thunder Bluff) -> back to Valormok.
# Carry-in matches the segment 17 file's carry-out: 32 and 81 (Orgrimmar), 2782 and 2995 (Undercity), 2741 (the Egg-O-Matic in
# Gadgetzan) and 2622 (Stonard). Segment 17 already hands in 3002, 2976, 7732 and 864. 8273 is taken from Oran after 2782.
# Carry-out to segment 19: 3908, 980, 4147 and 4293. 3570 (no objectives) and 4294 (Un'Goro oozes) are finished here.

# ---------- Stonard ----------
T 2622 @ Swamp of Sorrows, 45.0, 57.4 | Bengor in Stonard. He offers The Swamp Talker next: leave it
FLY Kargath | You start in Stonard; your hearthstone is still set there. Breyk, the wind rider master

# ---------- Searing Gorge ----------
N Take the trail that starts just north of Kargath and climbs into Searing Gorge, then cross the gorge north-west to the Cauldron | Have 15 Silk Cloth in your bags for an outhouse quest here. There is no Auction House before Undercity.
A 3441 | Kalaran Windblade, at the north-west edge of the Cauldron
T 3441 | Listen to his story
A 3442
F Thorium Point @ Searing Gorge, 34.8, 30.8 | Grisha, the Horde wind rider master at Thorium Point
A 7728,7729 | The Wanted board at Thorium Point. Skip WANTED: Overseer Maltorius (elite)
A 7723,7724,7727 | Hansel Heavyhands
A 7722 | Master Smith Burninate
C 3442,7723 @ Searing Gorge, 42.0, 50.0 | Heavy War Golems walk around the Cauldron and drop Golem Oil. Blazing, Inferno and Magma Elementals in and around the Cauldron drop Hearts of Flame (Magma Elementals can drop both). Frost Nova, then Blizzard
T 3442 | Back to Kalaran Windblade
A 3443
C 7729,3443,7728:1 | Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers on the Cauldron floor. Any Dark Iron dwarf can drop a Thorium Plated Dagger. The Smithing Tuyere drops from the Dark Iron Steamsmiths at the forges on the west side of the Cauldron (40, 49). Keep the Grimesilt Outhouse Key if one drops
C 7727,7722 | The Slag Pit is a tunnel that leads down from the Cauldron floor. Incendosaurs fill its lava pools: kill your 20 first. The Secret Plans: Fiery Flux lie on the ground at 40.5, 35.7, right beside Overseer Maltorius (elite 50) and his two elite Dark Iron Sentries (48). Do not try to clear them. Come in from the side away from them, click the plans, then Frost Nova, Blink and run back up the tunnel
C 7724,7728:2 @ Searing Gorge, 40.0, 62.0 | South of the Cauldron: Dark Iron Lookouts by the sentry towers (33, 54; 36, 61; 43, 63; 50-54, 56-59) drop the Lookout's Spyglass. An elite Dark Iron Sentry (48) guards each tower: pull the Lookouts away from it (the group at 53, 59 stands furthest from its Sentry). Greater Lava Spiders roam the lava pools and plateaus south and west of the Cauldron
T 3443 | Back north to Kalaran Windblade. Skip The Flame's Casing (elite)
T 7729,7728 | Taskmaster Scrange, Thorium Point
T 7723,7724,7727 | Hansel Heavyhands
T 7722 | Master Smith Burninate
L 50 @ Searing Gorge, 31.0, 45.0 | Quest XP runs about two levels short in this segment, so grind to 50 here. You need 50 for Bungle in the Jungle in Gadgetzan and for the level 50 class quest. Kill the level 47-49 mobs: Greater Lava Spiders on the west plateau (27-32, 37-50), and Heavy War Golems and Dark Iron Taskmasters along the west rim of the Cauldron (34-38, 41-48). The level 45-46 Slavers give about a fifth less XP. Skip the elite Dark Iron Sentries at the sentry towers (34, 54 is the closest) and beside Maltorius. Taskmasters drop cloth and the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep the key, you use it at the end of Searing Gorge. Frost Nova, then Blizzard
A 4449 | Ride east to the Wooden Outhouse at the Grimesilt Dig Site (65.6, 62.2) and talk to it. Leave Ledger from Tanaris alone: its items are in Dustwallow and the Swamp of Sorrows
C 4449 @ Searing Gorge, 63.3, 60.5 | Five Dark Iron Geologists dig right next to the outhouse; the other three work at 69, 33, far to the north. There are only eight in the zone: kill the five here, then wait a few minutes for them to come back rather than riding north. Dark Iron Watchmen stand among them. You also need 15 Silk Cloth
T 4449
A 4451 @ Searing Gorge, 65.6, 62.2 | Right-click the Grimesilt Outhouse Key. Still no key? Any Dark Iron Taskmaster or Slaver can drop it: the nearest stand at 58, 42, the rest on the Cauldron floor. Skip this pair if it will not drop
T 4451 | Use the key on the outhouse door

# ---------- Undercity, Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff ----------
N Teleport: Undercity from the dig site (or ride back to Thorium Point and fly to the Undercity if you don't have it)
TRAIN | Undercity Magic Quarter: learn the level 50 spells. With Classic spell timing, Portal: Thunder Bluff also comes at 50. Stock up on about 10 Runes of Teleportation: this segment uses a lot of Teleports
A 8250 @ Undercity, 85.4, 13.5 | Magecraft from Pierce Shackleton, at the mage trainers. Needs level 50. It ends at Sanath Lim-yo in Azshara
T 2782,2995 | Oran Snakewrithe
A 8273
T 8273
A 3568 | Chemist Cuely in the Apothecarium. You fill the vials in Azshara later in this segment
A 4294 | Chemist Fuely, right next to Cuely. The oozes for it live in Un'Goro, where you go next. Leave his Felwood quest (A Sample of Slime...) for your second Undercity stop
N Teleport: Orgrimmar (or take the zeppelin from the tower outside the Undercity if you don't have it)
T 32 | Zilzibin Drumlore in the Drag
A 4494 | Zilzibin Drumlore. Needs level 50
A 4300 | Jes'rimon in the Drag
T 81 @ Orgrimmar, 59.5, 36.6 | Dran Droffers, at the east end of the Drag
A 936 | Innkeeper Gryshka, Valley of Strength. Do not bind here yet
N Buy a Mithril Casing at the Auction House | It is an engineering part for the A-Me 01 robot in Un'Goro. If none is for sale, skip Chasing A-Me 01 parts 2 and 3 when you get there
N Teleport: Thunder Bluff (or fly there from Orgrimmar if you don't have it)
T 936 | Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem on Elder Rise
A 3761 | Collect about 50 Un'Goro Soil in total: 20 for this quest, 5 for Gadgetzan, and 2 for each Morrowgrain attempt later
FLY Gadgetzan | Thunder Bluff flight master, by the elevator
S Gadgetzan | Innkeeper Fizzgrimble at the inn. You hearth back here when you leave Un'Goro
T 2741 | The Super Egg-O-Matic machine, next to Andi Lynn: put in the Hippogryph Egg from Feralas. Curgle Cranklehop's egg quests that follow give no XP; skip them
