# ---------- Un'Goro Crater: the south-east corner ----------
A 4290 | Ride south-west out of Gadgetzan and down the trail into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa Pathfinder waits at the bottom
A 4289 | Torwa Pathfinder
A 3844 | A Wrecked Raft on the shore of the pond north-west of Torwa
T 3844 | A Small Pack, a few steps away in the water
A 3845 | Keep it for Linken at Marshal's Refuge
C 4290 | The Fresh Threshadon Carcass north of Torwa. From now on, loot every Power Crystal (red, green, blue, yellow) and every Un'Goro Dirt Pile you pass
T 4290
A 4291
C 4291,4300 @ Un'Goro Crater, 64.0, 72.0 | Walk up to the ravasaur eggs west of Torwa and Lar'korwi Mates come out to guard them; they drop the glands. Any ravasaur here can drop White Ravasaur Claws
T 4291 | He offers The Bait for Lar'korwi next: leave it until you pass him again in loop 2, to save log space
N From now on kill every ooze you pass until you have 15-20 Un'Goro Slime Samples (for ... and a Batch of Ooze) | Primal Oozes sit in the middle of the crater (on your ride north and around the hive), Muculent Oozes in the east jungle (loop 1) and Glutinous Oozes on the west side (loop 2). Not every sample tests as pure and you need 5 that do. They stack
G Un'Goro Crater, 45.2, 5.8 | Ride north through the middle of the crater to Marshal's Refuge. Keep looting crystals and soil. Leave the Devilsaurs and Stegodons (elites) alone

