C 3881:1 @ Un'Goro Crater, 68.5, 36.5 | The Crate of Foodstuffs at the abandoned Ironstone Camp
C 4289 @ Un'Goro Crater, 66.0, 16.5 | Ride north along the east side to Fungal Rock, the gorilla lair. Gorillas, Stompers and Thunderers drop the pelts; they often come in pairs. Leave U'cha (in the cave) for later
T 4243 | A-Me 01 sits at the foot of Fungal Rock
A 4244
