# ---------- Loop 2: northern pylon, the west, the hive, eastern pylon and Fire Plume Ridge ----------
C 4285 @ Un'Goro Crater, 56.5, 12.5 | The Northern Crystal Pylon, on the rise just east of the camp. Walking up to it completes the quest. Plain Pterrordax circle this rise: kill the ones you see for Beware of Pterrordax (you finish the 10 at the Gorishi hive later) and loot their Webbed Scales. Then ride south-west across the crater
C 4501:2,4145:2 @ Un'Goro Crater, 32.0, 40.0 | West side of the crater: Frenzied Pterrordax and Bloodpetal Trappers. The Frenzied Pterrordax also drop Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle
L 51 @ Un'Goro Crater, 32.0, 45.0 | Krakle's quest needs level 51. If you are not there yet, keep killing the Frenzied Pterrordax and Bloodpetal Trappers on this west side. Frost Nova, then Blizzard
A 974 | Krakle, at the Golakka Hot Springs
C 4288 @ Un'Goro Crater, 23.9, 59.2 | The Western Crystal Pylon
C 3882,4503 @ Un'Goro Crater, 33.0, 72.0 | Dinosaur Bone piles lie on the ground south of the pylon. Elder Diemetradons roam these bone fields: they drop bones and the Webbed Diemetradon Scales, and Frenzied Pterrordax here finish the Pterrordax scales. Stegodons (elite) roam here too, so give them room
C 3881:2 @ Un'Goro Crater, 38.4, 66.1 | The Research Equipment at the abandoned south-west camp. Pull the nearby Stegodons away first or slip in between them
C 3883,4496,4501:1 @ Un'Goro Crater, 49.0, 81.0 | The Gorishi hive in the south. Go in to a hatchery chamber with hanging larvae (48.7, 85.3) and use the Scraping Vial on the wall. Any Gorishi can drop the Scent Gland, and they drop soil too. Pterrordax circle the hive: finish the 10 for Beware of Pterrordax here
C 3761 | You should have 20 Un'Goro Soil by now. Keep collecting until you have about 50
T 4289 | Ride east to Torwa Pathfinder at the crater entrance
A 4292 | Torwa Pathfinder. Keep Torwa's Pouch: you fight Lar'korwi (level 56) on your way out of the crater, when you are higher level
A 4301 | U'cha (level 55) lives in the Fungal Rock cave. You kill him on the way out
C 4287 @ Un'Goro Crater, 77.2, 50.0 | Ride north from Torwa along the eastern side to the Eastern Crystal Pylon on the ridge. Walking up to it completes the quest
C 974,4145:3 | Ride west to Fire Plume Ridge, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Right-click Krakle's Thermometer at each hot spot until you find the hottest. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its south and east base
T 974 | Back west to Krakle
A 980 | Goes to Donova Snowden in Winterspring next segment
